  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005, 0.6501 accuracy) outperform PCA-based models. This experiment tests whether switching aggregation from avgpool to transformer (while keeping encoder and profile settings constant) further improves performance. It isolates the effect of aggregation method, which is critical for understanding model design trade-offs. This is a low-risk, high-impact test that balances exploitation of the scvi_n200 encoder's potential and exploration of aggregation strategies."  
